0,Dogon languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dogon_languages,"The Dogon languages are a small closely related language family that is spoken by the Dogon people of Mali and may belong to the proposed Niger–Congo family.West Dogon – Duleri, Mombo, Ampari–Penange, Budu. North Plateau Dogon – Bondum, Dogul.","Dogon, Ampari",Niger-Congo
